    <description>Keeps Showroom__c.Vehicle_Count__c equal to the vehicles physically in the showroom (every status except Sold). Showroom_Capacity_Not_Exceeded compares against this field; it was never populated before, so the capacity rule could not fire. Deleting a vehicle does not recount; the next vehicle save corrects it.</description>
